# The /zigcommerce admin command family: help text, listings and answers.
# The file name is the key PREFIX: an entry here resolves as ziggfreedcommon.commerce.admin.<key>.
# The desc.* keys are what the engine's own help resolves a command or an argument through.

desc.family = Inspect and administer this server's economy.
desc.validate = Audit every wallet, storefront and board on this server.
desc.wallets = List the wallets any pack defines.
desc.shops = List the storefronts, their shelves and where each shelf is in its rotation.
desc.boards = List the boards, their slots and where each board is in its rotation.
desc.show = Show one player's balances, purchases and rerolls.
desc.give = Add to a player's wallet.
desc.take = Take from a player's wallet.
desc.set = Set a player's wallet to an exact amount.
desc.resetlimits = Clear a player's purchase counts.
desc.resetrerolls = Clear a player's rerolls for the current period.
desc.arg.player = The player to act on. Defaults to you.
desc.arg.currency = The wallet id.
desc.arg.amount = A whole number.
desc.arg.shop = Show only this storefront, and its offers.
desc.arg.board = Show only this board, and its contracts.

more = ... and {0} more, in the server log.

validate.clean = Commerce content: nothing to report.
validate.counts = Commerce content: {0} errors, {1} warnings, {2} notes.
finding = {0} {1} [{2}] {3}

